{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此喻法華前三乘權法也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此喻開權無權，\n唯一究竟佛乘。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "通、別二教"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藏、通、別之三也"}
