{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即阿那律，阿難堂兄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即貪、瞋、癡、慢、疑、身見、邊見、\n見取、邪見、戒禁取也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即身見、邊見及戒禁取也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "只除\n身、邊二見，四諦共有三十二使"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上色、無色二界，各除四使瞋惑，每界但有二十\n八使"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "貪、瞋、癡、慢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "貪、癡、慢也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六根本即貪、瞋、癡、慢、疑、邪見也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見惑四使，修惑一使"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦如上二種人，得定、不得定異。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "頓、漸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三乘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四位"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "苦觀切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "其呪如經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此名前陳，謂之宗依"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此名後陳，亦曰宗體。須以\n二句合，方成體。合云：幽室即焦腑，焦腑即幽室。將前掛後，將后掛前，方曰諂宗"}
