{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音的，又音式"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或作非字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疏無同字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下入第三經。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同七條，以七條亦兩長一\n短故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下入第\n四經。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
