{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即三億二萬是金輪也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本作王字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "角彼切一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "呼鵙切，皮骨相離聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "呼獲切。庖丁即掌厨丁役之人，供𦠆者也。或云：丁，名也。文惠王即梁惠王也。解即宰\n割也。踦，刺也。言善能宰牛，見其間理，故以手搏觸，以肩倚著，用脚踏履，用膝刺築，遂使皮肉離折，砉然響應，進\n奏鸞刀，󴑾然而解。蓋寄庖丁明養生之術也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "桑林，殷湯樂名也。經首，咸池樂章之名，即堯樂也。庖丁妙盡牛理，既解割聲響，\n雅合宮商，所以音中桑林經首也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音希，歎聲也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋，捨也。所\n好養生之道，故寄伎以獻君也。又進者，過也。艱生之道，過於解牛之伎也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "始學未達，所見皆牛，亦猶養生始學，未照理境，觸途之礙故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "才覩於牛，便知空郄，亦猶服道日久，智照漸明，所見無非虗幻\n故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經十九年，合陰陽之妙數，牽神以會\n理，亦猶學道妙契玄極，靈心虗照，豈用目取邪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "官，主司之謂也，即日\n主色等類也。既以神照，不用目視，故眼等主司悉廢止也。從心欲順理，行道亦爾也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "依天然之腠理，終不枉截傷牛。養生自然性心，必不貪生以夭折也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "間郗交際，用刀而批\n\n戾之，令各離異。學道至生死窮際，用心觀照，令其解脫也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "苦管切，骨節空處，足導令殊。學\n道之人，以有資空，以空導有也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因其空郗，所以運刀，眼見耳聞，必不妄有分別"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "伎之妙也，常游刃於空，未甞經槩於徵礙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古胡切，大\n骨也。又盤骨註云：軱，戾大骨，衂刀刃者也。衂，女六切，鼻出血。俗作衂，又挫也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "養生用智，妙體真空，\n細惑尚不染心，麤塵豈容累德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不中其理間也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "良善之庖，猶未\n中理，經乎一歲，更易其刀。況小學之人，未體真道，證空捨有，易奪之心者矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中骨而折刀也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "況凡鄙之夫，心靈闇塞，觸境皆礙，必損智傷神"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "硎，砥礪石也。十，\n陰數。九，陽數。雖解牛多鋒，如新磨養生，妙盡陰陽，雖千變萬化，而常湛然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第四下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀音、觀門"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六根取境，不離三世、四方。一念之心，三世具足。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下入第五經。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "披莇切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "苦盍切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因明家〔積〕，此為前陳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此名後陳。應合\n云：空即有為，有為即空，名為諂宗也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世間共許聲是所聞，却云\n非所聞性，故相違也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "缾本無常，今却云常，故相違也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如佛弟子立空華是實有。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聲雖共許，能別滅壞，數論不許，故不極成。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "思惟\n共許，我即不許，小已破我故也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "神我和合成，佛弟子俱不許故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因須兩家共許，方能成立未共許宗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼此俱不許故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此所作因〔亡〕者\n雖許，敵者不許"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "既不決定，即不能生敵者智也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前陳有法是因所依性故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經部不許虗空是實有故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若立因於同異品上皆有，名共不定"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所聞性於同異品上俱無，則不能成聲上常等義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無常性於同品電上有、空上無，於異品缾上却徧有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無常性於同品缾徧有，於異品電有空無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今無質礙，於同品空有微無，於異品上樂欲有缾無"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "但自成得常宗，決定違於所作性無常宗。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "常無常是相違。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此由\n因不令云所作性，故類宗成相違也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "詮言為自相，詮言外各自意許\n名差別。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此數論對佛弟子，意欲成立神我是常，能受用眼等根。若立神我為有法，以佛\n弟子不許有神我，即犯所別，不極成故。矯立云：眼等為他受用，他即神我。意許神我是實，有積聚。他用眼等是\n役我，無積聚。明既不許後陳眼等有積聚，即無同喻也。以臥具是有積聚性故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此勝論師立六句法，第四名大有，是一是常，能有實德業三法。五頂弟子不信別有大有\n體。意云：實德業便是能有，豈更有大有體？此以有性非有性為相違。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "意道唯有實等一實。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師見弟子不信離實等法外有性，乃不離彼一實。因立作有緣性，成\n立有射。意道有是境能牽生心，性是所有，心即有之性也。其弟子由能違量云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師意許性屬大有，弟\n子意道境當體是性。此以有緣性非有緣性為相違。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "極微雖常，奈有質礙，聲、勝二師共許\n聲無質礙，故不成也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "覺即心、心所，法雖無質礙，於所常宗即不成，以心、心所才生即滅故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "缾有質礙，是無常故，於宗、因俱不成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無配合也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若合云諸無常皆所依故即倒，應云諸所作皆無常故即不倒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "微塵\n是常，於宗不遣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼計業無質礙故，於能成不遣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "空於宗不無常性，於因不無無礙性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不離是不相屬著義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "合云空若是常，定非所作"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "合云諸有常性，見彼無礙。大抵異喻離，則先宗\n後因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "桑箇切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音泪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第五卷下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勢力取世，\n不違其志，故名世志。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下入第六經。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即十六行相，辨上二界，令"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並鄧臣，侯\n亦外甥也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如噬自臍，終不可及"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下入第七經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "香草"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世于功"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下入第八經。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初得慧日，名明得定。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明相轉增，名明增定。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從此無間\n必入見道，名為無間。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音喝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "叱涉切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音赤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "刻其額，以\n墨指之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "截其鼻也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "剕其足也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "死刑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十斤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十斤"}
