{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六十斤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下入第九經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二無漏心、二有漏心、二無漏心為三\n心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一、二、三果云生方便者，此據本說也。本者，謂一生中修習，秪得初果。\n此人成無學後，若生方便，須經八萬大劫方迴心也。餘果例知。然是敷逼之談，要令其人憚遠，速於此世迴心。\n\n其實生彼，聞勝應佛說法訓誘，未必須經爾許時也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七內切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下入第十經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "直是切，又音祉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大帶"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
